1. Key Pair          (no dependencies)
2. VPC               (no dependencies)
3. Internet Gateway  (needs VPC)
4. Subnet            (needs VPC)
5. Route Table       (needs VPC + Internet Gateway)
6. Security Group    (needs VPC)
7. Route Table Association  (needs Subnet + Route Table)
8. EC2               (needs Key Pair + Subnet + Security Group)
9. File Provisioner  (needs EC2 to be running)
10. Remote-exec      (needs EC2 to be running + file copied)